	"excerpt": "AlfredでMacの音声を切り替えるAlfred Workflowを作った",
	"feature_image": "https://hanatane.net/content/images/2024/02/tanenobu_a_man_who_wears_a_bowler_hat_with_a_purple_ribbon_is_l_91d58dce-418a-4635-bc4c-d7ecdd75edb3.png",
